<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>CSS variables</title>
    <style>
      :root {
        --color: rgb(255, 0, 247);
        --seccolor: rgb(231, 164, 246);
        --defpad: 23px;
        --defop: 0.4;
        /* defop decides visibility of text */
        /* defpad is default padding which we can use for styling everywhere in css */
      }
      * {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
      }
      .nav {
        background-color: blueviolet;
      }
      ul {
        display: flex;
        border: 2px solid maroon;
      }
      ul li {
        opacity: var(--defop);
        list-style: none;
        padding: var(--defpad);
        border: 2px solid var(--seccolor);
      }
      .cont{
        background-color: (var(--color));
        border : 2px solid var(--seccolor);
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="nav">
      <ul>
        <li>Name</li>
        <li>Skills</li>
        <li>Contact</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="cont">
      Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Corporis nihil a
      repudiandae aspernatur nobis! Exercitationem tempore non, error ab
      voluptates, aperiam eveniet pariatur nulla iure accusantium deserunt
      veniam, unde molestiae aliquid obcaecati. Eligendi ad libero voluptates
      laudantium amet eum! Rem laudantium a consequatur iure expedita.
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
